/**
 * @defgroup DspCore_Example_GeneratorsWindows Windows
 * @ingroup DspCore_Examples_Generators
 * @brief Generate symmetric Hann and Hamming analysis windows.
 *
 * @section DspCore_Example_GeneratorsWindows_Goal Goal
 * Inspect a small Hann window at every sample, compare Hamming endpoints and
 * center, and verify the meaningful one-sample limit.
 *
 * @section DspCore_Example_GeneratorsWindows_Run Run
 * @code{.bash}
 * ./build/macos_arm64/bin/Debug/DspCore_Generators_Windows_d
 * @endcode
 *
 * @section DspCore_Example_GeneratorsWindows_Output Output
 * @code{.text}
 * Hann[0]=0%
 * Hann[1]=50%
 * Hann[2]=100%
 * Hann[3]=50%
 * Hann[4]=0%
 * Hamming endpoints=8%; center=100%
 * Singleton window=1
 * Overall: PASS
 * @endcode
 *
 * The five Hann samples make its symmetry tangible; the singleton result avoids
 * treating a degenerate analysis window as an error.
 *
 * @section DspCore_Example_GeneratorsWindows_Code Implementation
 * \include Generators/Windows/Shared.cpp
 */
